        - target: :math:`(N)` or :math:`()` where each value satisfies :math:`0 <= \texttt{target[i]} <= \texttt{n\_classes}`
        - output1: :math:`(N)` or :math:`()`
        - output2: ``Scalar``

    .. _Zipf's law: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zipf%27s_law

